  <diagram id="risc-v-instruction-path-f01-instruction-family" name="RISC-V record-load and property-load instruction roles" ecgTitle="RISC-V record-load and property-load instruction roles" ecgDescription="Four numbered roles distinguish ordinary and FlowThrough record loads from computed-address and indexed ReuseBind property loads. Compact decode uses the record-format CSR and widens into the canonical metadata layout before the property instruction consumes the plan.">
